Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; AI Workflow feature flags for one user (pilot group) (VAI-109). Normally written by GPO
; (User Configuration) or Intune for the users in the pilot group: the Policies key is read-only
; for normal users. 1 = on, 0 = off. Missing = off. Restart AI Workflow to apply.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\AI Workflow]
"Meetings"=dword:00000001
"Agents"=dword:00000000
"Voiceprints"=dword:00000000
